Only problem - Nintendo may not be the way to go. From what I have
seen and heard, Sega may be a better bet for the next couple of
years, with Atari making a big comeback. Also, think about who uses
these systems. I am sure this is a generalization, but _most_ of
the more mature video-game junkies I know play Sega, while most Nintendo
